# Tests read these byte for byte (vectors, keys, snapshots, compiler output, and
# the spec whose hash `cargo xtask verify-spec` checks), so keep them exactly as
# committed on every OS. Without this, Windows checkouts would get CRLF.
*.rs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.pem text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.snap text eol=lf
*.stderr text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.p12 binary
